{"version":1,"content":"<p>台灣不老男神男星吳奇隆於上月31日喜迎56歲生日，團隊特別運用AI技術製作人生回顧短片，將他從少年孭起頭家、小虎隊紅遍亞洲，到憑《步步驚心》「四爺」再創事業高峰的半生經歷串聯成輯。</p><p>原本開玩笑想看動畫片的他，在《青蘋果樂園》、《紅蜻蜓》等經典</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:23:36.472178+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T08:01:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.045737+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T08:18:41.045737+00:00","content_hash":"6442127841ebd786c4bf72088a05f3121f98013d96f75c5e132bb8b8bcbf7476","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}